00:05:57.033 --> 00:05:58.367
But here's the thing.

00:05:58.367 --> 00:05:59.767
Jimmy and I both
have television shows.

00:05:59.767 --> 00:06:02.000
They're both an hour long.
-Uh-huh.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.033
-We should have the same amount
of merch in the NBC store.

00:06:04.033 --> 00:06:06.267
-We're in this building
together.

00:06:06.267 --> 00:06:09.133
-I had to do a collage to get
all the "Tonight Show" merch.

00:06:09.133 --> 00:06:10.934
That's a "Tonight Show" --
Look at that.

00:06:10.934 --> 00:06:13.901
There's a whole -- by the way,
second card, "Tonight Show."

00:06:13.901 --> 00:06:17.501
"Late Night" merch, just like
one like barely attended wall.

00:06:17.501 --> 00:06:19.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.234 --> 00:06:20.667
-That's not bad.
-Look, there's only one --

00:06:20.667 --> 00:06:22.567
Thank you.
There's only one show --

00:06:22.567 --> 00:06:24.868
There's only one show
that has less merch than me.

00:06:24.868 --> 00:06:27.834
And it hasn't been
on the air for years.

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:30.767
That's it.
-Oh, that's fantastic.

00:06:30.767 --> 00:06:33.033
I like "Saved by the Bell."
-Thank you.

00:06:33.033 --> 00:06:35.467
-Yeah. So in your --
But I was saying to you,

00:06:35.467 --> 00:06:36.934
I think that --
-You came up with a great idea.

00:06:36.934 --> 00:06:38.534
You solved this problem.
-I think I did.

00:06:38.534 --> 00:06:40.334
-Yeah.
-I said, because "Closer Look"

00:06:40.334 --> 00:06:42.267
is one of your
biggest things you do

00:06:42.267 --> 00:06:43.834
and the biggest hits
on your show.

00:06:43.834 --> 00:06:45.734
People tune in for that.
You do a great job, by the way.

00:06:45.734 --> 00:06:47.968
The whole, by the way, congrats.
The show is fantastic.

00:06:47.968 --> 00:06:50.234
-Thank you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:50.234 --> 00:06:51.601
-And you do a great job.

00:06:51.601 --> 00:06:56.300
I go, "I think you should
have a T-shirt that says..."

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.934
-"It's time for."
-..."it's time for."

00:06:57.934 --> 00:06:59.601
-In big letters.
This was your idea.

00:06:59.601 --> 00:07:01.567
"It's time for"
and then here's the shirt.

00:07:01.567 --> 00:07:04.567
In tiny little letters,
because we're going to do this,

00:07:04.567 --> 00:07:06.167
